{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36453","headline":"秋日怀江上友人 · 罗邺","name":"秋日怀江上友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行子岂知烟水劳，西风独自泛征艘。\n酒醒孤馆秋帘卷，月满寒江夜笛高。\n黄叶梦余归朔塞，青山家在极波涛。\n去年今日逢君处，雁下芦花猨正号。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}